    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446450/extras/6ccf5df105f4e86b046107b3b09887af.avif?t=1744699262\" width=548 height=180 /></span>Find cute cats in  White Sand Village. Can you find them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow Meow...Kittens are calling you\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446450/extras/ab9b4385385b787f0330acbab6b2570a.avif?t=1744699262\" width=548 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Hand drawn cartoon minimalist style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 More than 300 cats here </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Explore White Sand Village<br>\u00b7 Find cats to color the scene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Sounds of cats can help you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Drag and zoom the screen view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Relax and find all the cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446450/extras/a3eca38e3c0982016de293e49463e98d.avif?t=1744699262\" width=548 height=180 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446450/extras/6ccf5df105f4e86b046107b3b09887af.avif?t=1744699262\" width=548 height=180 /></span>Find cute cats in  White Sand Village. Can you find them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow Meow...Kittens are calling you\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446450/extras/ab9b4385385b787f0330acbab6b2570a.avif?t=1744699262\" width=548 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Hand drawn cartoon minimalist style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 More than 300 cats here </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Explore White Sand Village<br>\u00b7 Find cats to color the scene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Sounds of cats can help you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Drag and zoom the screen view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Relax and find all the cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446450/extras/a3eca38e3c0982016de293e49463e98d.avif?t=1744699262\" width=548 height=180 /></span></p>",
